  {"t":"open","key":"exit_fixstraw","q":"Fix this straw man so it states the other side fairly: \"People who want a later bedtime just want to stay up all night.\"","min":12,"rows":2,"rubric":["A fair, realistic reason someone might want a later bedtime (homework, family time, sleep schedule)"],"model":"Some kids argue for a later bedtime because they want time to finish homework and spend time with parents who get home late."},
